---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Culture & Sights" description="Museums, parks, theater, and local artists near the farm.">
	<p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/activities">Activities</a> › Culture &amp; Sights</p>

	<div class="page-header">
		<h1>Culture &amp; Sights</h1>
	</div>

	<div class="prose">
		<ul class="entry-list">
			<li>
				<a href="/activities/marbacka">Mårbacka</a><span class="entry-meta">20 min drive · Östra Ämtervik</span>
				<p>The childhood home of Nobel Prize-winning author Selma Lagerlöf.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="entry-title">Sundsbergs gård</span><span class="entry-meta">5 min drive · Sunne</span>
				<p>A small art exhibit, with Sunne's answer to IKEA — a large flea market — right across the street.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="/activities/rottneros-park">Rottneros Park</a><span class="entry-meta">2 min drive · Rottneros</span>
				<p>One of Scandinavia's largest Nordic sculpture parks, inspired by Selma Lagerlöf's stories.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="/activities/alma-lov-museum">Alma Löv Museum of UnExp::: Art</a><span class="entry-meta">25 min drive · Östra Ämtervik</span>
				<p>Ranked among Sweden's top 5 modern art museums by Dagens Nyheter. A must-see for art enthusiasts.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="entry-title">Västanå Teater</span><span class="entry-meta">2 min drive · Rottneros</span>
				<p>An annual summer theater production based on one of Selma Lagerlöf's stories. Tickets sell out early — the plays are in Swedish and draw visitors from across the country.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="entry-title">Ridgedale farm</span><span class="entry-meta">15 min drive</span>
				<p>A small farm run strictly on permaculture principles. Sells fresh produce and ecological poultry in summer.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="/activities/vildhjarta-westerberg">Maria "Vildhjärta" Westerberg</a>
				<p>A Sunne-born artist known for her "stick art" — worth a search.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="/activities/klassbol">Klässbol</a><span class="entry-meta">~35 min drive</span>
				<p>Home to Klässbols Linneväveri, weavers of the Nobel Banquet's table linens since 1991.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="/activities/rackstad-museum">Rackstad museum</a><span class="entry-meta">~35 min drive</span>
				<p>Home of the Rackstad Colony, Sweden's foremost turn-of-the-century artist colony.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</Layout>
